# Secrets & local-only config — must never be baked into an image.
**/.env
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/secrets.json
**/values.dev.yaml

# Runtime data — uploads belong on a volume, not in the image.
wwwroot/uploads/

# Build output
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log

# VCS & editor metadata
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm

# Not needed at build time
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/azds.yaml
**/charts
LICENSE
README.md
